    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "Yes, I used a chatbot once to understand a complex algorithm. It helped me visualize the code and how it solved problems. It was easy to ask follow-up questions. I felt empowered by getting immediate feedback, even if I didn’t fully grasp every concept. It’s a helpful supplement to traditional learning.",
